    "opts": [
     {
      "l": "She hugs Fluffy"
     },
     {
      "l": "She looks around the classroom"
     }
    ]
   },
   "hint": "Touch Ela!",
   "ask": "What do you do when you say goodbye to someone?"
  },
  {
   "text": "Ela hugged Fluffy. Miss Nur said, “Shall we show him the classroom?” But what was this? The toys were shy too! They were all hiding!",
   "hits": {
    "ela": {
     "say": "Where are you, toys?"
    },
    "ogretmen": {
     "say": "Shhh… Something moved over there!"
    }
   },
   "mech": {
    "done": "Good morning, toys! Ela giggled: tee-hee!",
    "msg": "You found them all!"
   },
   "hint": "Find the hiding toys!",
   "ask": "Why might the toys be hiding? Do they feel like Ela does?"
  },
  {
   "text": "Can was sitting on the rug. He was new too. He missed his dad. Ela held out Fluffy: “First play, then lunch, then a story. Then your dad comes!”",
   "hits": {
